--- !u!114 &114256196744784513
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1857363845242078}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 276
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 那物主想要交换的物品，和这堕山的骨骸一样，乃是六品的化神期妖兽材料。而且必须是金属性，或是混元属性的材料。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114273159719779434}
  AvatarIntID: 0
